<title>UK: IADB sets 500 million mark five-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>IADB sets 500 million mark five-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers ABN AMRO Hoare Govett, CS First Boston and Westdeutsche Landesbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   INTER-AMERICAN DEVELOPMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   COUPON     4.75	MATURITY    20.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.023   PAY DATE    20.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    99.648    SPREAD	+20 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    FRANKFURT PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.375     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND BOBL 119 -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
